  // jungle-part2: the ten bird path functions. jak3 needs the same shape for its
  // identical part-wascityb-birdN-path family (jak3/ntsc_v1/type_casts.jsonc), but
  // jakx needs one cast more. Op 13 is the (- <timer-target> (-> arg1 timer))
  // subtract, which type prop cannot reconcile without knowing v1 is an int. The
  // other two type the process reached through the particle's launch-control as a
  // part-spawner: in jak3 part-spawner and process-drawable both put root at the
  // same offset, so only the last-velocity read needed a cast, but in jakx
